MAYOR OF PADANG SIDEMPUAN
NORTH SUMATRA PROVINCE
REGIONAL REGULATION OF PADANG SIDEMPUAN CITY NUMBER 3 OF 2021
CONCERNING
WOMEN'S EMPOWERMENT AND CHILD PROTECTION
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
THE MAYOR OF PADANG SIDEMPUAN,

Considering a. that women and children are creatures of Almighty God who have human rights guaranteed by the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia, therefore women and children must be protected from all forms of violence and discrimination;

b. that violence against women and children in the Region tends to increase, therefore the Regional Government and/or community need to play an active role optimally to provide protection, so that women and children are prevented and free from violence or threats of violence, torture, or treatment that degrades human dignity and honor;

c. that protection of women and children is a mandatory concurrent affair which is the authority, obligation, and responsibility of the Regional Government, thus requiring regulation as a basis for implementing comprehensive and integrated protection of women and children;

d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Women's Empowerment and Child Protection in Padang Sidempuan City;

In View of 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;

